roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:68646","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"KIZAWA studio(株式会社KIZAWA studio、キザワスタジオ)","creatorId":"vndb:s592","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:13068","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s592","name":"KIZAWA studio(株式会社KIZAWA studio、キザワスタジオ)","detail":"デモムービー","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:74077","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"薬師 るり","creatorId":"vndb:s2361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2361","name":"薬師 るり","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:15306","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c44099","characterName":"入谷 友里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134772","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"131011"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18375"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44099"},"originalCharacterName":"入谷 友里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main heroine. The daughter of a family of 12. She is a military officer by nature, with the rank of second lieutenant. She values honor and military service, and will not hesitate to risk her own life for the sake of her countrymen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As is customary for an Imperial soldier, she uses slightly outdated language, refuses to tolerate any deviation, and always does her utmost to get things done. For this reason, she is rather conspicuous in the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, because she is a very serious person, she gradually gains the trust of everyone at the school. She does not see herself as an individual attractive woman, so she is not conscious of her own individuality in her behavior."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44099"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"士官学校を首席で卒業した、有望な軍人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若いながら名誉と武勲と重んじ、国家国民のためなら命を惜しまない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曲がった事や不正を決して許さず、常に全力で物事に当たるタイプで、主人公の姉という形で学園に潜入するが、女性らしからぬ言動と、威風堂々とした態度で周囲から浮いてしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉弟として編入したため、主人公と同室だったりするが、自らを女性として意識していないため、危機感は希薄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「軍人にとって優秀かどうかは、任務をこなせるかどうか。それしかない」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18375","sourceWorkId":"10720","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccac7eeb29a1d24d21aeb6bb7bca1ab5bd2b84398467399021feb9aee11a5509.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e6bfa8c2dac742c1fcac27a34d6d4c4e4ad8aa182882272936f834de123b9c14.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:131011:134772:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44100","characterName":"アメリア・バウアー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134773","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"131011"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18376"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44100"},"originalCharacterName":"アメリア・バウアー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A friendly and energetic girl who loves sports, she is very popular at the school and has excellent athletic skills."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has earned the nickname “Princess General of Gelavri,” which is why she was the first target of Iriya's investigation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has the poor fate of always being unwittingly caught up in Iriya's espionage activities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44100"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とイリアが編入したクラスのクラス委員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツ万能で面倒見の良い、爽やかな少女で、クラスの皆から慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもイリヤの諜報活動（という名のトラブル）に巻き込まれ、なんだかんだで苦労が絶えない、本作のオチ担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の事がちょっぴり気になるようだが……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うむ。よろしい――なぁんてね。イリヤさん風に言ってみましたー。あはははっ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18376","sourceWorkId":"10720","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b35e7e3cc12311e66c7ebd6846ae144f3c9a3982a940d6eefebeadb81d870f36.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e6c3608f26ff1bb59d0a4515caef32efe76b365bd3ff9fec3ebecb2c16d90f9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:131011:134773:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44101","characterName":"ジャネット・グリムターゼ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134774","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"131011"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18377"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44101"},"originalCharacterName":"ジャネット・グリムターゼ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the daughter of a large aristocrat and wealthy family. She is a critic of the empire and a domineering figure under the umbrella of her father's and the nation's authority."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is always accompanied by three cronies who are always in a waistcoat. She hates people who are better than her and has a one-sided rivalry with the all-powerful Amelia."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But after the confrontation between Iriya and Amelia, she begins to see Iriya, who can do everything to the best of her ability, as her rival as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44101"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"家は大物貴族＆資産家、父は学園理事という、絵に描いたようなお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目、性格もお嬢様然としており、いつも取り巻き三人組を引きつれ、自由気ままに威張り散らす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に自分より「出来る」人間が大嫌いらしく、万能なアメリア、全力なイリヤを一方的にライバル視しているようである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何も知らずに、イリヤやマチカの前で帝国批判をぶち上げては、二人に酷い目に合わされるオチ担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「アメリアなんかと友達になるより、ずっといい目を見せてあげるわ。おーっほっほっほっ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18377","sourceWorkId":"10720","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f10142d95281e11e0b0d43b450d8055db6106945c374edda8f2ab56f01f9cf8a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/011b26c586be42983e20b6f383fbd5ac29dd59baabd5b8a88aa66f09a86bdaad.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"新堂真弓","creatorId":"vndb:s1427","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1427","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1427","name":"新堂 真弓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:131011:134774:6166:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44103","characterName":"マチカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134776","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"131011"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18379"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44103"},"originalCharacterName":"マチカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a brilliant woman, and is the director of the Duke's Operations Command and Kurosu's superior. She is also Kurosu's sister, kind of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first, she was commenting on the protagonist's reports at the dukes' command center, but then she thought it would be interesting and came to the school as a teacher herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44103"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「帝国保安局」局長にして、穏健派八公家の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは、幼い頃から義姉弟の間柄で、今は、報告を受ける上司でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……のだが、何故か教師として、自ら学園に潜入してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が関係筋の人間である事を、主人公に口止めさせていているが、イリヤは、マチカの只ならぬ雰囲気に、次期姫将軍候補かと警戒しているようで、主人公の頭痛のタネは増える一方。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「先生、君とは初対面のはずなんだけどな。それとも、前にどこかで会った？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18379","sourceWorkId":"10720","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d059f00a5e34c0496675196021815e4e9d030172bcca446290fb6f576d8b36f4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/5246dcb02fca63cd4fb1e09716e686878c937933b384bd9dc79915415bc9d775.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鳴海エリカ","creatorId":"vndb:s112","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s112","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s112","name":"鳴海 エリカ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:131011:134776:4489:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44104","characterName":"奈々井","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134782","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"131011"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18380"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44104"},"originalCharacterNa